<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\春の山.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\荒田森1朝.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>While we walked through the forest, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> said nothing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Nor did she show any sign of attacking me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But her back left no opening.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I pointed the muzzle at her now, she would be standing in front of me like before―<PG>
For a while now, the birdsong had been catching my ear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I've heard that birds are creatures sensitive to bloodlust, but does <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> have none?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Though if anyone is giving off bloodlust, it's probably me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">She</STYLE> stopped in front of a hole gaping open in the rocks.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> glanced at me for an instant, then slowly went into the hole.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She must want me to go in with her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What could be in there?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Tools to torture me, or a <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="ろうや">cell</STYLE>...<PG>
But not going in was no longer an option.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had been ready to destroy this place and get the death penalty, and yet my legs were shaking badly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Some attachment to life still in me...<PG>
No, that's wrong! For these 4 years, I have lived only for revenge!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I can carry it out, then this life of mine...!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Telling myself that, I dragged my shaking legs into the hole.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\歩く響く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
In the dark space, my sight was taken from me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then the scene from earlier came back to me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, killing the cub.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">That girl</STYLE> is capable of that kind of cruelty at times.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I'm judged to be a danger―<PG>
The moment I thought that, my legs started shaking again,
{STOPSND "VOICE" "500" "PASS"}
and I stopped walking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was scared... scared to go any further.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Scared of being killed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My heart screamed out my pathetic true feelings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I wanted to cover my ears, it spoke straight to my auditory cortex, stirring up my attachment to life.<PG>
So revenge, for someone like me...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll go home... Yes, that's the thing to do!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'll turn on my <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="きびす">heel</STYLE> right now!<PG>
But my eyes gradually adjusted, and I began to see the space further in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No, far from a space further in, there was no space beyond where I stood.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Dazzling sunlight was shining in from above.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was this bright, and still my fear had robbed me of my sight.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\秘密基地昼中.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
A rock ceiling so low a person could barely stand, and a cramped, oppressive space.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Sunlight leaked in through gaps in the rock, but even so, it took my eyes a few dozen seconds to adjust.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apart from some snack wrappers scattered around, there was nothing strange.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And right beside me, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, you don't have to be afraid. I won't do anything." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had she sensed my fear?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> thought of my feelings first.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\swish.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> sat down on a hemp rush mat.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, please sit down too. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">It's all right. I won't do anything..." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She gave me a smile that eased the tension.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Okay..." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no running away anyway.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I bent my trembling knees and sat down too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"This is my secret base." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Secret base?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\すきま風の声.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> seemed to be in middle school, but a secret base felt a little young for her age.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"The only ones who know about this place are </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Papa</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mama</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">So please don't tell anyone else about this place." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> winked and held her index finger up in front of her lips.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A cute smile...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To my eyes, there didn't seem to be any bloodlust in that smile.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Keep it a secret, please." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't know how to answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't intend to tell anyone, but more than that, I didn't understand why she would ask me for a promise like that.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the first place, why had she brought me all the way here...?<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">............" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"............ </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">............" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For just under 10 seconds, we were both swallowed by silence.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was I supposed to answer something?<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"All right. I won't tell anyone about this place." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> smiled again, as if relieved.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Thank you." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But those were the only words that came back.<PG>
That was when I realized.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> was revealing her own secret to draw out my real reason for coming here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, a trade of secrets.<PG>
The <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="りょうしん">tumor</STYLE> ached again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My heart gave a sharp throb.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Destroying this place, how could I ever say a thing like...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Momoko-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, I'd like you to keep this a secret too..." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE> began to speak again, never letting her gentle smile slip.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A battle of wits with <STYLE ID="1">Kana-chan</STYLE>, a good 10 years younger than me―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I can't take her lightly just because she's in middle school.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"My 15th birthday is on August 1. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Before I turn 15... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">I'm planning to leave the settlement." </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh...?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a secret far removed from a secret base.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Leaving here, she said, but given the time of year it couldn't be for school, and it seemed she hadn't told anyone yet, either.<PG>
Having heard this much, I couldn't not ask.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Why are you leaving?" </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Soon I..."</STYLE><PG>
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
